  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.0 adds independent retained CursesPanel surfaces over the stable 1.0/1.1 window contract. Panels provide deterministic screen-owned z-order, show/hide, movement, opaque or blank-transparent composition, clipping, Unicode/wide-cell and semantic-metadata coherence, damage-bounded incremental recomposition, live CursesSession refresh/lifecycle integration, and deterministic IDisposable removal for transient panels. Ordinary CursesWindow shared-view semantics remain unchanged and no-panel refresh retains an allocation-free fast path. The 1.2 public contract adds exactly CursesPanel and CursesPanelTransparency over 1.1. Runtime dependencies are Icod.Terminal 1.9.0 and Icod.TermInfo 1.10.0; AssemblyVersion remains 1.0.0.0.",
